Proposed System Interface
Ito ang magiging pangunahing pages o screens ng system.

01. Login Page
School logo and system name
Email/username field
Password field
Login button
Forgot password option

02. Student Dashboard
Welcome message
Enrolled subjects
Upcoming deadlines
Recent announcements
Pending assignments

03. My Subjects / Learning Materials
List of subjects
Lessons and modules
Downloadable files
Teacher's uploaded resources

04. Assignments and Quizzes
Activity instructions
Due dates
File upload or online answers
Submit button
Submission status

05. Grades and Progress
Quiz scores
Assignment grades
Teacher feedback
Academic progress

06. Teacher Dashboard
Manage subjects
Upload learning materials
Create quizzes and assignments
Review student submissions
Record grades and post announcements

07. Admin Dashboard
Manage student and teacher accounts
Manage subjects and classes
Monitor system records
Configure system settings
